-# 🌍 Social Trends MCP
+MCP stdio server and PostgreSQL-backed REST service for public social trend feeds. This checkout contains local repairs to caicai-yao/social-trends-mcp; they have not been pushed upstream. The workspace-level setup script reapplies the cumulative patch to the tested upstream commit.
 
-**Real-time trending topics from X, TikTok, YouTube & Instagram — as an MCP Server**
+## Actual source coverage
 
